1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,110
The reason is that
for the first time in

2
00:00:03,110 --> 00:00:06,169
four years I said
something that was

3
00:00:06,169 --> 00:00:09,472
actually true and
slightly costly to say.

4
00:00:09,908 --> 00:00:12,479
Everything before that
had been optimized

5
00:00:12,479 --> 00:00:14,779
into a shape that
offended nobody and

6
00:00:14,779 --> 00:00:15,922
interested nobody.

7
00:00:16,898 --> 00:00:19,860
Let me be specific
about what I mean,

8
00:00:19,860 --> 00:00:23,093
because "be authentic"
is useless advice

9
00:00:23,093 --> 00:00:25,165
and I hate
hearing it too.

10
00:00:26,483 --> 00:00:29,315
There is a measurable
thing happening

11
00:00:29,315 --> 00:00:30,065
here.
